sequenceDiagram
  participant Launcher as 启动脚本
  participant Main
  participant Java as JavaRuntime
  participant Core
  participant UI as Renderer
  Launcher->>Main: 明确资料空间与运行环境
  Main->>Java: 启动当前 Jar
  Java->>Core: 独立令牌与资料目录
  Core-->>Java: 已准备的动态回环端口
  Main->>Core: 挂载并验证文本词典
  Main->>Core: 读取设置
  Main-->>UI: 完整业务就绪
  UI->>Main: desktopState / runtime
  Main-->>UI: 资料状态与能力状态
